INTERFACE zif_az_http_pipeline_policy PUBLIC.

  METHODS process
    IMPORTING
      io_request TYPE REF TO zcl_az_http_request
      io_context TYPE REF TO zcl_az_pipeline_context
    RETURNING
      VALUE(ro_response) TYPE REF TO zcl_az_http_response
    RAISING
      zcx_az_http_error.

ENDINTERFACE.